<section class="ref-group"><h2>Battles <span class="n">37</span></h2><ul class="enc-list"><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-tolentino"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-tolentino.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Tolentino</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 2–3 May 1815</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Tolentino was fought on 2–3 May 1815 near Tolentino in the Marche, Italy, between Joachim Murat's Neapolitan army and the Austrians.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-bangkusay-channel"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-bangkusay-channel.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Bangkusay Channel</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 3 June 1571</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Bangkusay Channel was fought on 3 June 1571 in Manila Bay, off Tondo near the mouth of the Pasig River.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-maserfield"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-maserfield.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Maserfield</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 5 August 642</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Maserfield was fought on 5 August 642 between Penda of Mercia and Oswald of Northumbria, probably at Oswestry in Shropshire.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-ponza"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Ponza</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 5 August 1435</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Ponza was a naval battle fought on 5 August 1435 off the island of Ponza in the Tyrrhenian Sea.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-puebla"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-puebla.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56