268)</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 18 February 1268</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Wesenberg was fought on 18 February 1268 near Rakvere in northern Estonia between an army of Novgorod and Pskov, led by Prince Dmitry of Pereslavl and…</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battles-of-lexington-and-concord"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battles-of-lexington-and-concord.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battles of Lexington and Concord</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 19 April 1775</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battles of Lexington and Concord, fought on 19 April 1775 in Massachusetts, were the first military engagements of the American Revolutionary War.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-epila"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Épila</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 21 July 1348</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Épila was fought on 21 July 1348 near Épila in Aragon.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-taillebourg"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-taillebourg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Taillebourg</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 21–22 July 1242</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Taillebourg was fought on 21–22 July 1242 at the bridge over the Charente at Taillebourg in Saintonge.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-cassel-1071"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-cassel-1071.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Battle of Cassel (1071)</span><span class="enc-type">Battle · 22 February 1071</span><span class="enc-snip">The Battle of Cassel was fought on 22 February 1071 near Cassel in Flanders over the succession to the county.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href